#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-fft-how-it-works.rst:7
#: 711e112c327747ed85f484fb99b8ad65
msgid "How it works"
msgstr "飞行中 FFT 的工作原理"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-fft-how-it-works.rst:9
#: d54b528f18c7417591caa9a60fcca051
msgid ""
"The FFT takes a set of gyro samples, performs frequency analysis on that set"
" and yields a set of frequency bins with associated energies representing "
"how \"much\" of a noise signal is in that bin. For example if we take a set "
"of samples of length 32 - referred to as the *FFT length* or *window size*, "
"*N* - this would yield a set of frequency bins each of width *f*\\ :sub:`s` "
"/ *32* where *f*\\ :sub:`s` is the sampling frequency of the samples. Since "
"these samples are from the gyros the sampling rate is most commonly 1KHz and"
" therefore each bin is approximately 32Hz wide. FFT analysis will give an "
"energy value for each bin representing the amount of noise energy of that "
"frequency in the bin. So for instance if our motor noise is at 80Hz most of "
"the energy will be in the third bin and we can thus tell from the energy "
"values the approximate frequency of the noise. The highest frequency that "
"can be detected by an FFT is the Nyquist frequency of *f*\\ :sub:`s` / *2*"
msgstr ""
"FFT 取一组陀螺仪采样，对其做频率分析，得到一组频率仓（bin）及各自的能量，表示该仓内噪声信号的\"多少\"。例如取长度为 32 的一组采样——称为"
" *FFT 长度* 或 *窗口大小*、*N*——将得到一组宽度各为 *f*\\ :sub:`s` / *32* 的频率仓，其中 *f*\\ "
":sub:`s` 是采样频率。由于这些采样来自陀螺仪，采样率通常为 1KHz，因此每个仓约 32Hz 宽。FFT "
"分析会给出每个仓的能量值，代表该仓频率上的噪声能量。比如电机噪声在 80Hz，则大部分能量会落在第三个仓里，由能量值即可判断噪声的大致频率。FFT "
"能检测到的最高频率是奈奎斯特频率 *f*\\ :sub:`s` / *2*"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-fft-how-it-works.rst:11
#: aa9ae55f5d4a4634ae8cb0402bca16f8
msgid ""
"Clearly increasing the FFT length yields much higher frequency resolution "
"and one might think therefore that we should always use long FFTs. Two facts"
" prevent this. Firstly the calculation of an FFT costs roughly *O(N log N)* "
"in CPU time, thus longer FFTs quickly become prohibitively expensive. "
"Secondly FFTs have a Heisenberg-like relationship between frequency and time"
" - you can choose high time resolution or high frequency resolution, but you"
" cannot have both at the same time. For multicopters time resolution is "
"important because the calculated frequency might be used to drive time-"
"sensitive controls such as the dynamic harmonic notch. Thus the choice of "
"FFT length should be made carefully based on how accurate the frequency "
"calculation needs to be versus the timeliness of the result. For larger "
"multicopters or helicopters a high frequency resolution can be beneficial, "
"whereas for smaller copters with sensitive attitude control high time "
"resolution is important. The default of 32 generally works well and can be "
"run on F4 processors. Higher values such as 128 require F7 processors and "
"anything above this should typically only be run on an H7."
msgstr ""
"显然，增大 FFT 长度能获得高得多的频率分辨率，你可能因此认为应该总是使用长 FFT。有两个事实决定了不能这样做。其一，FFT 的计算量约为 *O(N"
" log N)* 的 CPU 时间，因此更长的 FFT 很快就贵得离谱。其二，FFT "
"在频率与时间之间存在类似海森堡不确定性的关系——你可以选择高时间分辨率或高频率分辨率，但无法同时兼得。对多旋翼而言时间分辨率很重要，因为计算出的频率可能用于驱动动态谐波陷波这类对时间敏感的控制。因此"
" FFT "
"长度的选择要在频率计算的精度与结果的时效性之间仔细权衡。对大型多旋翼或直升机，高频率分辨率更有益；而对姿态控制敏感的小型多旋翼，高时间分辨率更重要。默认值"
" 32 通常表现良好，F4 处理器即可运行。128 之类更高的值需要 F7 处理器，再往上通常只应在 H7 上运行。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-fft-how-it-works.rst:13
#: ba33d028aa1c4199981de05162fa133e
msgid ""
"An alternative to increasing the FFT length is to decrease the sample rate "
"to yield higher frequency resolution. This has the drawback of reducing the "
"highest frequency that can be detected, but for some lower frequency "
"platforms (e.g. helicopters) this might be appropriate."
msgstr "FFT 分析的最低频率由 ``FFT_MINHZ`` 控制，最高频率由陀螺仪采样率的一半决定（奈奎斯特频率）。"
